    "description": "\n    The Apollo 11 Lunar Module (LM) Eagle was the first\n    crewed vehicle to land on the Moon.\n\n    It carried two astronauts, Commander Neil A. Armstrong\n    and LM pilot Edwin E. Buzz Aldrin Jr., the first men\n    to walk on the Moon.\n\n    The Lunar Module also carried the Early Apollo\n    Scientific Experiment Package (EASEP), which consisted\n    of scientific experiments deployed on the lunar surface.\n\n    The astronauts collected lunar rock and soil samples,\n    deployed scientific instruments, took photographs,\n    and explored the lunar surface.\n    ",
